{"time": 1761138999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357953246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“还有你，那个牢里面的，你也过来，你又是谁”"}
{"time": 1761139057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649015899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们是鱼化人，我们的首领和梅利森达成了约定，只要我们帮她渗透进这个建筑里，她就允许我们事后烧杀抢掠”鱼人说"}
{"time": 1761139077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30193350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "至于牢里的家伙，看起来非常害怕的样子“别杀我，别杀我...”"}
{"time": 1761139141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033237363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "(梅利森是哪位来着)"}
{"time": 1761139176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680797807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（消灭奥特兄弟的计划）"}
{"time": 1761139182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936528213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（是美丽森定的）"}
{"time": 1761139191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823079754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（梅里森是劳尔斯离开这座城市之后，鸢尾庄园的实际掌控人（））"}
{"time": 1761139206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1377878230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（最早出自德鲁伊的密信）"}
{"time": 1761139215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811584596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你是谁?来这干什么?\"问牢里的人"}
{"time": 1761139218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301730149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我们需要更多让人昏睡的药~梅里森）"}
{"time": 1761139273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384132289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "(哦哦)"}
{"time": 1761139309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941402816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"那个会钻进镜子的变形怪，是你们什么人？\""}
{"time": 1761139342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077087194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我叫肖恩，我被一群黄衣服的人给抓到这里了，他们说要把我当成什么祭品...”肖恩看起来非常害怕的样子"}
{"time": 1761139365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942398467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么?\""}
{"time": 1761139424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552072410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个人是梅里森大人从异界召唤来的，通过变形取代了原本的副官，然后他杀死了本身的治安官，对外宣布治安官失踪，然后故意不给民兵发工资，遣散了民兵....”"}
{"time": 1761139481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179195716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1942398467][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “我也不知道...好多人都被抓来了，然后好像说他们被带到了鸢尾庄园献祭了...我不想死，我还得照顾我的妹妹”肖恩看起来快崩溃了"}
{"time": 1761139485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153342280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“什么邪教徒”"}
{"time": 1761139523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605713015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们回想到之前你们似乎也被黄衣服的邪教徒袭击过"}
{"time": 1761139531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516941045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"你是干什么的？\""}
{"time": 1761139533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161738011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不过那段剧情的时候灵风还不在）"}
{"time": 1761139535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446543796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，这真的是，没什么可说的。\""}
{"time": 1761139545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692967433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=516941045]（问小鱼人吗）[CQ:at,qq=1009793416]"}
{"time": 1761139566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706096687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=692967433][CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 商人"}
{"time": 1761139574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114879755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（商人是？）"}
{"time": 1761139598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633253554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（小黑人吧）"}
{"time": 1761139623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826303895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我就是个普通的市民啊...从来没干过伤天害理的事情，求求你们，放我出去吧”"}
{"time": 1761139664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327813578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...在这种地方，我也没办法对你做什么决定，不过我们会带你会城市。\""}
{"time": 1761139701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684188888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢，谢谢..谢谢几位恩人”"}
{"time": 1761139722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948933635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"你被抓进来多久了？\""}
{"time": 1761139723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721152588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之后交给城市那边的人处理吧。\""}
{"time": 1761139785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607497061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“最近四五天吧...本来这里还有好多的人，但都被带走了...”肖恩说到"}
{"time": 1761139806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54702816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后小鱼人补充道“那些人都被带到鸢尾庄园献祭了”"}
{"time": 1761139963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186727151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“你还有其他的东西要交代的吗”"}
{"time": 1761139963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227906182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "*御史几天前过来的？"}
{"time": 1761139996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953932385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“御史？好像是有个穿着很华丽的人，不过她已经死了....”"}
{"time": 1761140004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285004762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小鱼人说到"}
{"time": 1761140047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396337054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1186727151][CQ:at,qq=2422497068] “监狱深处听说有宝藏，可以放了我吗，姑奶奶，我知道的都说出来了”"}
{"time": 1761140075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613082129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“赫赫，我只说了你不交代一定会死，可没有答应过你，交代了就放你走”"}
{"time": 1761140097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382680749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么.！你好阴险！！！！！”他转身就想逃跑"}
{"time": 1761140111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446636146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "捅死他"}
{"time": 1761140123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249709623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那他含恨离世"}
{"time": 1761140125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451017013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“哼，想逃？”"}
{"time": 1761140130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149590166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呃”"}
{"time": 1761140135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870817735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你是不是有东西忘记问了”"}
{"time": 1761140142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729953033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（有吗）"}
{"time": 1761140145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372078346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有吗）"}
{"time": 1761140147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038673773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（有吗）"}
{"time": 1761140148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924067318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（我看你们该问的都问了）"}
{"time": 1761140154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371763332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（没问的，那稍微回档一下问吧）"}
{"time": 1761140154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666030822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 你倒是等问问尸体在哪儿再杀啊"}
{"time": 1761140170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251399286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵，还真是）"}
{"time": 1761140172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657685204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“刚刚他们说监狱深处有什么鬼魂之类的东西，而且御史大人死在哪？”"}
{"time": 1761140183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304671353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你把他就这么杀了？”"}
{"time": 1761140183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372736155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "另外那个泥怪是咋来的也得问问"}
{"time": 1761140184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291170264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（他进剧情进的太快了，我的台词已经憋了很久了）"}
{"time": 1761140193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345371135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（情不自禁说出来了）"}
{"time": 1761140199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620562131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我好像听那群小鱼人聊天有说过”肖恩自告奋勇"}
{"time": 1761140203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685181179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（这样吧，让我们回到他死之前，再问一会？）"}
{"time": 1761140223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310054277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“御史大人的尸体好像也被带到鸢尾庄园了....”"}
{"time": 1761140355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228555361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那监狱深处的鬼魂?\""}
{"time": 1761140357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984237061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那是什么\""}
{"time": 1761140450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668933971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像有个传闻....”"}
{"time": 1761140494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143692535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说说看。\""}
{"time": 1761140674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782935859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以前有个叫克莱姆斯的医生，人们说他和现任劳尔斯爵士的父亲，也就是劳尔斯三世的妻子内米尔有染，然后老劳尔斯爵士就不让他们两个人见面，结果一个月后，劳尔斯三世爵士得了稀奇的疾病，爵士怀疑是医生报复他就把他抓进这个监狱的拷问室，就是南边那个屋子里严刑拷打，后来还把他处决了，尸体似乎在扔在那里”"}
{"time": 1761140708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228287655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"后来冰流堡的人们就经常听到监狱的深处传来呜咽声，大家都不敢靠近...\""}
{"time": 1761140730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775209191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这件事应该冰流堡里也有文件记录了...几位大人感兴趣的话可以去档案室找找”"}
{"time": 1761140762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551653067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“和你们在一起的那种泥怪是怎么来的 ？”"}
