{"time": 1761224524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267612074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“说起来”"}
{"time": 1761224535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320688752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“关于梅丽森这个人，我们有什么情报吗？”"}
{"time": 1761224563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974596064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=214339366](9费爆能扫3，双打疾驰)"}
{"time": 1761224588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214820089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(闭嘴，既然已经舍弃了未来，闪开，不要挡在英雄的路上)"}
{"time": 1761224647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706492081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她本来是鸢尾庄园的管家，后来劳尔斯离开之后，鸢尾专员就完全由她负责了，听说她把以前的仆人之类的全给遣散了”瑟莎蒂亚补充道"}
{"time": 1761224680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734205417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "‘’哦？"}
{"time": 1761224684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073496378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“根据我的冒险经验”"}
{"time": 1761224689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375668911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“我的意思是，关于她能不能打架，有什么能力”"}
{"time": 1761224695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094883247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“他可能是已经变成食尸鬼了”"}
{"time": 1761224702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868600946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“我们知道些什么吗？至少知道她是不是个施法者吧”"}
{"time": 1761224713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121381450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我觉得已经成了那什么黄衣的使者。”"}
{"time": 1761224718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557748413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“或者是在庄园里面养一些邪恶的，不能见人的丑陋生物”"}
{"time": 1761224845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664988580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“额，关于这些我确实不太清楚了，不过之前按你们收集的情报来说，她不是召唤过一些异界的邪恶生物，所以应该会施法吧”"}
{"time": 1761224881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602622351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这么邪恶，不过我也见过有这样的法术。\""}
{"time": 1761224887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568589628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说不定我之后也会用到。\""}
{"time": 1761224906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564591595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“你知道鸢尾庄园大致的地形吗？”"}
{"time": 1761224942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864318008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“这么邪恶”"}
{"time": 1761224946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512100533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“有没有地图”"}
{"time": 1761225129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256220979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=477CFA994D3B8ECFD312723551B32FA8.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSiJoHBjizfT1cBx5BDUpa-r3nFaRjrmGog_woomfiV8LK6kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQHGQ3RwbP5oh_Bv8tmVRcEHoCZF6CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMH3WYi80GOh8qDA3LWcuyVGIfzb3aIzGQukKEWaSLcaCvQYB42A0Y2XKuurKJaBq9A,file_size=1739883]她找了找，拿出了一张地图递给你们“大致地形是这样的，然后建筑从右上角逆时针分别是 待客厅，马厩，厨房，主邸，每个建筑都有两层高，然后被一圈树篱围绕”"}
{"time": 1761225207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883472694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“很好，这下我没什么问题了”"}
{"time": 1761225231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167620166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，依我所见，如果有大规模的法术，直接扔过去就完事了。\"看向罗娜兰，\"兰姐，你什么时候能抬手翻云覆雨。\""}
{"time": 1761225257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283263893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵，你把建筑炸没了，你怎么找劳尔斯的踪迹）"}
