{"time": 1761232407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582576720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那多谢小姐了，为表感谢，几位小姐要不要喝点酒..很好喝的”"}
